<title>SINGAPORE: Thai refiner Bangchak seeks 1,500/T April MTBE.</title>
<headline>Thai refiner Bangchak seeks 1,500/T April MTBE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai refiner Bangchak Petroleum Plc is seeking 1,5000 tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for second-half April delivery, industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender closes and is valid on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its last MTBE tender Bangchak bought its March requirement from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC) at $280-$285 per tonne c-and-f Thailand.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
